  "short_description": "Runtime diagnostics framework for error observation and reporting",
  "long_description": "\n@waysnx/ui-diagnostics provides a comprehensive error diagnostics and observability system for React/UI applications.\n\nKey Capabilities:\n- Runtime error classification and analysis\n- Form validation error capture and reporting\n- Schema and rule engine error tracking\n- Component-level error context preservation\n- Privacy-aware diagnostic sampling\n- Multi-channel error reporting (console, HTTP, memory)\n- Error deduplication and fingerprinting\n- Application, route, form, and component-level diagnostic context\n",
  "capabilities": [
    "Runtime error classification",
    "Form validation diagnostics",
    "Error reporting pipeline",
    "Console reporting",
    "HTTP remote reporting",
    "Error deduplication",
    "Privacy sampling",
    "Diagnostic context"
  ],
